_imputacion_design_mapping_shape", "label": "Mapping shape (sourceField, targetField, transformer, required, description, options, _evidence)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-13-completar-catalogo-mappings-alta-solucion-impacto-imputacion/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Underscore-prefixed documentary properties such as _evidence must not be inserted into MongoDB by a future loader."}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_13_completar_catalogo_mappings_alta_solucion_impacto_imputacion_design_alta_section_rules", "label": "Alta section rules", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-13-completar-catalogo-mappings-alta-solucion-impacto-imputacion/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Separate new Alta fields from Datos basicos duplicates; person, company, requester or owner fields stay unconfirmed until the internal model decides ID, name, email or full structure."}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_13_completar_catalogo_mappings_alta_solucion_impacto_imputacion_design_datos_basicos_section", "label": "Datos basicos section (existing mapping base)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-13-completar-catalogo-mappings-alta-solucion-impacto-imputacion/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_13_completar_catalogo_mappings_alta_solucion_impacto_imputacion_design_solucion_section_rules", "label": "Solucion section rules", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/changes/archive/202